    description: "Found by the 2026-11-01 P3 stale-item review (~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc3/, dev 100b6fbb6e). r_lang.py:488 builds dst_id = f\"r:external:{path_hint}::{func_name}\", which is not a 5-slot id; canonicalisation then yields r:external:0-0::external_symbol with empty name, so every qualified R call collapses onto one nameless node. Fixture misc3/fx_fivof."  # 064b
